{
  "info": {
    "name": "Motoya v2 - Módulo Notificaciones",
    "_postman_id": "motoya-notifications-v1",
    "description": "Colección Postman para el módulo de notificaciones de Motoya v2.\n\n## Canales disponibles\n- WHATSAPP (Factiliza)\n- EMAIL (JavaMail / SMTP)\n- SMS (Twilio)\n\n## Endpoints disponibles\n| Método | Ruta | Descripción |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| POST | /api/v1/notifications/send | Envío síncrono (texto/template) |\n| POST | /api/v1/notifications/async | Envío asíncrono Outbox |\n| POST | /api/v1/notifications/email | Email síncrono |\n| POST | /api/v1/notifications/email/async | Email asíncrono Outbox |\n| POST | /api/v1/notifications/send/media | WhatsApp con archivo de Storage |\n| POST | /internal/notifications/process | Procesar cola Outbox |\n\n## Variables de entorno requeridas\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080\n- `firebase_token`: Bearer token de Firebase Auth\n- `internal_token`: Token para endpoints internos (default: `cambiar-en-prod-123`)\n\n## Autenticación\n- Endpoints `/api/v1/notifications/*` → Header `Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_token}}`\n- Endpoint `/internal/notifications/process` → Header `X-Internal-Token: {{internal_token}}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "firebase_token", "value": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_FIREBASE", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "internal_token", "value": "cambiar-en-prod-123", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Envío Directo (Síncrono)",
